  title "Keelo's Reaching"
  summary "A mysterious crystal shard arrives at ☽'eocmoum's trading stall, bearing the mark of the Icebound Exchange and originating from a catastrophic event in the deep tunnels where miner Keelo sacrificed herself to contain an eruption of aurora-fire, crystallizing into the shard. As ☽'eocmoum holds the artifact, she becomes entangled in its supernatural pull—it compels those who touch it to speak their names, drawing them toward fatal heat, while spreading frost spirals that echo the dead's reaching gestures. During the Ritus∴um ceremony, ☽'eocmoum realizes the shard uses the ritual itself as a mechanism to call the living toward the dead, and she chooses to record its sale in the ledger, perpetuating the cycle of warmth and death that sustains the colony."
